{"id":"jjkdomain","lines":[{"t":1.39,"end":11.77,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"Mrghghhaa","de":"Mrghghhaa","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":11.77,"end":14.1,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"Quit your whining.","de":"Hör auf zu jammern.","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":14.1,"end":16.92,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"Because at this point","de":"Denn an diesem Punkt","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":16.92,"end":24.45,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"WORDS ARE MEANINGLESS!","de":"SIND WORTE BEDEUTUNGSLOS!","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":24.45,"end":26.45,"chars":[4],"who":"Yuta","text":"Domain Expansion","de":"Sphären Entfaltung!","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":24.45,"end":26.45,"chars":[3],"who":"Uro","text":"Domain Expansion","de":"Sphären Entfaltung!","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":24.45,"end":28.58,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"Domain Expansion","de":"Sphären Entfaltung!","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":28.58,"end":32,"chars":[5],"who":"Rika","text":"Yuutaa? GIVE HIM BACK!","de":"Yuutaa? GIB IHN ZURÜCK!","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":32,"end":36.44,"chars":[3],"who":"Uro","text":"Even if it tries to penetrate the barrier later","de":"Selbst wenn er später versucht, die Barriere zu durchdringen","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":36.44,"end":38.65,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"I ain't gonna drag this out.","de":"Ich werd das hier nicht in die Länge ziehen.","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":38.65,"end":41.16,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"Let's settle this, nice and sweet","de":"Lass uns das schön und sauber klären","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":41.16,"end":45.03,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"At that moment, the black devil of the modern age.","de":"In diesem Moment, der schwarze Teufel der Moderne.","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":45.03,"end":50.3,"chars":[6],"who":"Kurourushi","text":"I told you, I like the taste of IRON","de":"Ich hab's dir gesagt, ich mag den Geschmack von EISEN","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":50.3,"end":53.26,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"Flew into the barriers","de":"Flog in die Barrieren","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":53.26,"end":55.26,"chars":[4],"who":"Yuta","text":"*Gasp","de":"*Keucht","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":53.26,"end":55.26,"chars":[3],"who":"Uro","text":"*Gasp","de":"*Keucht","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":53.26,"end":54.24,"chars":[1],"who":"Ryo","text":"*Gasp","de":"*Keucht","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":54.24,"end":55.8,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"*Kurourushi","de":"*Kurourushi","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":55.8,"end":60.61,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"had completed parthenogenesis before going dormant","de":"hatte die Parthenogenese abgeschlossen, bevor er in Ruhezustand ging","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":60.61,"end":64.75,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"So Kurourushi was still alive and well as a cursed spirit","de":"Also war Kurourushi noch am Leben, als Fluchgeist","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":64.75,"end":69.56,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"The complex forces of their domains had been keeping them apart","de":"Die komplexen Kräfte ihrer Domains hatten sie bisher auseinandergehalten","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":69.56,"end":73.39,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"But this intruder was unexpected","de":"Aber dieser Eindringling war unerwartet","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":73.39,"end":82.9,"chars":[2],"who":"Narrator","text":"And so the barriers... collapsed","de":"Und so... brachen die Barrieren zusammen","orig":"scenes/jjkdomain/lines/23.mp3"}]}